      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALABAMA SHOWDOWN (4)  won a Mdn at Goulburn as favourite before closing strongly for second to Youre Not The King at Hawkesbury. Collett sticks with him as he lines up here and he's progressing nicely this campaign. Finds a suitable race on his latest rating and can get back to winning ways. DUCK FOR COVER (5) has not quite delivered in two CL1 runs at Kembla, but last start he raced wide and was still only beaten just over three lengths. Coming back in trip is a big tick and a drop to country level also suits. Can run an improved race. COMMANDING BELLE (2) was plain at Kembla Grange, yet her Moruya fourth was much better after being held up and she has won twice around this trip. ZOUKERINO (3) hasn't been far away his past couple and commands respect.",
